      <h2 class="section-heading">IN THE SPOTLIGHT:</h2>
      <h3 class="sub-heading">College of Education Assessment—Accomplishments and Challenges</h3>
      <p class="byline">By <span data-field="author_name">{{ author_name }}</span>, Director/Professor, Office of Teacher Education</p>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>Most folks you talk to today would agree that there exists a high level of concern about the quality of public education in our nation. That concern is inevitably linked to issues of quality for the teachers and other school personnel who are front-line in our schools. Interestingly, national surveys indicate that parents are concerned about the quality of classroom teachers in general, but they have very positive opinions about the quality of the teachers in their local school. Such a dichotomy of perception and expectation are the foundation of much political decision making as the</p>
